    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A traditional, stone-built, three-room cottage with a large plot and outbuildings. Located within 2km of Portnoo's Blue Flag Beach and Golf Course with the heritage town of Ardara approximately 6km from the cottage. Vacant for a number of years, this property is a great renovation project in a sought-after location. Subject to meeting various criteria, the cottage qualifies for a number of home improvement grants. Internal accommodation comprises of entrance porch, kitchen/living room, two bedrooms and a bathroom. There are a number of stone-built outbuildings contained on this spacious plot which measures almost one acre. All enquiries welcome."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Stone-built, three-room cottage.<br><br>\nReception Porch - 2.3m x 2.2m <br>Floor tiled. \nWindows on three sides. <br><br><br>\nHallway - 4.2m x 1.4m <br><br><br><br>\nKitchen/Living Room - 4m x 2.7m <br>Low level kitchen units. \nDesigned for range (none fitted).\nDual aspect windows. <br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 4m x 3.5m <br>Dual aspect window. \nOpen fire. \nAccess from kitchen/living room. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 4m x 3.8m <br>Access off hallway. \nDual aspect window. \nOpen fire. <br><br><br>\nBathroom - 2m x 2.2m <br>WC and bath.\nPlumbed for WHB (not fitted at present). <br><br>"
      },
